# Vite loads this file for `npm run dev` only (mode=development). `vite build`
# runs in production mode and never reads it, so nothing here reaches a built
# bundle.
#
# The dev server and cmd/api are two origins (5173 and 8080); production, the
# clean test mode and `vite preview` are one. api/client.ts therefore defaults
# to same-origin and the two-origin case is the exception, declared here rather
# than remembered as a command-line variable — forgetting it produced a build
# whose every request left the deployment, with no error until the first fetch.
#
# The API side of the same arrangement is DEV_CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
# on cmd/api; see README and httpx.DevCORS for why this is not a Vite proxy.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
